D/SDE), the undervoltage release MN LV429410 (24 V DC) and the long terminal shields LV429517.</elementInformation><elementInformation name="auxiliary1" show="0">Compatible accessory</elementInformation><elementInformation name="description_auxiliary1" show="0">Standard motor mechanism module MT250 for ComPacT NSX250, control voltage 220-240 V AC 50/60 Hz (208-277 V AC 60 Hz), consumption below 500 VA, automatic spring charging, padlocking still possible, supplied with an SDE adapter. Motor terminals M1-M2 ASSUMED.</elementInformation><elementInformation name="designation_auxiliary1" show="0">Motor mechanism module MT250, ComPacT NSX250, 220/240 V AC</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_auxiliary1" show="0">Schneider Electric</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference_auxiliary1" show="0">LV431541</elementInformation><elementInformation name="quantity_auxiliary1" show="0">1</elementInformation><elementInformation name="auxiliary2" show="0">Compatible accessory</elementInformation><elementInformation name="description_auxiliary2" show="0">Standard auxiliary contact for ComPacT NSX, NS, PowerPact and EasyPact CVS: ON/OFF (OF), trip (SD), fault trip (SDE) and earth-fault trip (SDV) indication depending on its slot. One changeover contact (1 NO + 1 NC on a common point), 6 A, spring terminals. Terminals C, NC, NO.</elementInformation><elementInformation name="designation_auxiliary2" show="0">Auxiliary contact OF/SD/SDE/SDV, 1 changeover, spring terminals</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_auxiliary2" show="0">Schneider Electric</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference_auxiliary2" show="0">29450</elementInformation><elementInformation name="quantity_auxiliary2" show="0">1</elementInformation><elementInformation name="auxiliary3" show="0">Compatible accessory</elementInformation><elementInformation name="description_auxiliary3" show="0">Instantaneous undervoltage release MN